WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.677 --> 00:00:26.658
Cinderella danced with the prince.

2
00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:30.452
The king and queen watched them.

3
00:00:30.453 --> 00:00:35.229
"What a beautiful princess!" they said.

4
00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.549
The fine ladies stared too.

5
00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:42.647
"Who made the princess' gown?" they asked.

6
00:00:42.648 --> 00:00:45.304
"I want one!"

7
00:00:45.305 --> 00:00:49.608
"Me too!"

8
00:00:49.609 --> 00:00:54.515
Then Cinderella sat down with the prince.

9
00:00:54.516 --> 00:01:06.619
Servants brought out trays of food.

10
00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.933
The prince didn't eat a thing.

11
00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:17.929
He just stared at Cinderella.

12
00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.504
Cinderella spotted her stepsisters.

13
00:01:22.505 --> 00:01:30.606
She smiled at the prince. "I'll be right back."

14
00:01:30.607 --> 00:01:34.575
Cinderella brought some treats to her stepsisters.

15
00:01:34.576 --> 00:01:38.308
They thanked her and each gave a curtsy.

16
00:01:38.309 --> 00:01:42.742
Cinderella giggled quietly.

17
00:01:42.743 --> 00:01:47.816
They thought she was a real princess!

18
00:01:47.817 --> 00:01:56.807
The prince and Cinderella began to dance again.

19
00:01:56.808 --> 00:02:00.157
Before midnight Cinderella stopped.

20
00:02:00.158 --> 00:02:02.676
"I must go," she said.

21
00:02:02.677 --> 00:02:06.084
"Oh," the prince said sadly.

22
00:02:06.085 --> 00:02:08.732
"I'm having another ball tomorrow.

23
00:02:08.733 --> 00:02:10.894
Will you come?"

24
00:02:10.895 --> 00:02:20.755
"I will try," Cinderella said.

25
00:02:20.756 --> 00:02:25.084
At home, Godmother was waiting by the fire.

26
00:02:25.085 --> 00:02:29.671
"Oh, Godmother!" Cinderella said.

27
00:02:29.672 --> 00:02:32.469
"I had a wonderful time at the ball.

28
00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:44.859
The prince is so handsome!"

29
00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:49.373
Soon Cinderella's stepsisters came home.

30
00:02:49.374 --> 00:02:54.000
Cinderella yawned and stretched.

31
00:02:54.001 --> 00:03:01.592
She acted sleepy.

32
00:03:01.593 --> 00:03:05.867
"How was the ball?" she asked.

33
00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:09.564
Trudy frowned. "It was terrible."

34
00:03:09.565 --> 00:03:14.012
"Some dumb princess showed up," Gert said.

35
00:03:14.013 --> 00:03:22.975
"After that the prince ignored us!"

36
00:03:22.976 --> 00:03:27.940
Cinderella fell asleep with a smile.
